[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   step_117: Prospective validation cohort -- post-2017 SBDB long-period
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   comets through the identical bidirectional boundary instrument.
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   Every transit-channel test so far (steps 030-042, 063-086, 102-106)
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   runs on catalogue comets discovered before 2018 -- the Warsaw, CODE and
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   one-apparition tables that also defined the axis, the cap and the slip
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   map.  This step breaks that closure.  It downloads the complete JPL
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   SBDB comet table and selects every comet discovered in 2018 or later --
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   a cohort that could not have entered any fit, scan or registration --
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   and passes it through the identical REBOUND/DE440s bidirectional
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   instrument validated in step 063 (the instrument that reproduces the
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   catalogue's own boundary solutions to a median 0.001 deg per leg).
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   Two independence statements are made at once:
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   * out-of-time: the axis (l,b) = (34,-13) deg, the 60 deg cap and the
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   bipolar slip map were all fixed on pre-2018 data; this cohort is a
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   genuine prospective holdout;
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   * out-of-lineage: the osculating elements are JPL SBDB orbit
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   solutions -- a fourth orbit-determination pipeline, independent of
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   the Warsaw school that produced every orig/fut catalogue used so
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   far.
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   Cohort (pre-declared, mirroring the CODE class-1 selection)
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   * provisional designation C/2018+ (post-CODE cutoff; CODE is
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   near-complete through 2017);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   * 0.95 < e < 1.5 (near-parabolic; excludes ISOs and bound comets);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   * 0.1 < q < 3.1 AU (deep plungers, the class-1 regime; Kreutz-family
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   sungrazers excluded);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   * data arc >= 30 d and >= 20 observations used (orbit quality);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   * primary designation only (fragment components excluded);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   * a bound periodic control cohort (e < 0.95, 2018+) is carried
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   through the same instrument -- the boundary rotation requires
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   reaching the boundary.
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   Channels (identical instruments to steps 063/065)
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T1  cap contrast of the full-pass rotation drot (in- vs out-cap,
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   Mann-Whitney + theta-permutation null);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T2  rotation-per-kick residual: log(drot) regressed on
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   [log|daa|, log(d_enc), q, i]; cap contrast + Spearman vs theta;
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T3  continuous cap-free Spearman(theta, drot);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T4  energy channel |d(1/a)| in/out (expected flat -- the TEP
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   discriminator is rotation without energy exchange);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T5  implied proper-time offset dtau = drot/om_b with the step-065
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   linear residual -> unexplained offset in years, in- vs out-cap;
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T6  three-leg decomposition: inbound-leg vs outbound-leg rotation
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   residual (the inbound-weighted claim of Section 4.1);
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T7  bipolar slip-map transfer: a + b cos(2*theta) fitted on the
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   pooled CODE+Warsaw residuals (step_b30 products) scored on the
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   new cohort -- out-of-sample Spearman and lobe sign accuracy;
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T8  aphelion-direction dipole of the reconstructed inbound
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   asymptotes: cap count vs uniform baseline and vs the CODE
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   cohort's own measured cap rate;
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T9  periodic-comet control: identical cap test on bound 2018+
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   comets that never reach the boundary sphere;
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T10 geometric control: the identical cap test with the transit
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   axis rotated 90 deg in ecliptic longitude -- same cohort,
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   wrong axis, expected flat;
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   T11 subset tiers: the CODE class-1 dynamical equivalent
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   (0 < 1/a_back < 100 x 10^-6 AU^-1, Oort-spike first
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   arrivals) and the pure-gravity subset (SBDB solutions
[2026-09-20 12:21:22 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 117]   without fitted A1/A2/A3/DT non-gravitational parameters).
